On a 1200-S, a port 7 LAN trunk is one switch_port interface entry plus one vlan (SVI) entry per VLAN. It replaces the po1 + po1.X sub-interface pattern the repo uses on the 3200s. The SDK already passes both types through on apply, but it needs two small fixes and one live check before first use. I changed no repo files.

